<title>RUSSIA: WEATHER - Conditions at CIS airports - October 25.</title>
<headline>WEATHER - Conditions at CIS airports - October 25.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Airports on Sakhalin Island may be closed on October 26 due to strong winds and snow, the Russian Weather Service said on Friday.</p>
<p>Flights may be postponed on October 27 at airports on the Kamchatka peninsula, the Kurile islands and in the Magadan region in the Russian Far East due to strong winds, the service said.</p>
<p>-- Moscow Newsroom +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
